{
  "_doc": "OPS-08 fixed fixture table: TS resolveStoreFrontOpen (vitest lib/stores/__tests__/store-front-commerce-open-sql-twin-parity.test.ts) and SQL public.store_front_commerce_open (isolated DB run.sh) must both return `expected`. now = UTC instant (Asia/Manila = UTC+8).",
